# App platform — observability (Grafana first)

- **Default**: Grafana Cloud Free. Do **not** add Checkly, Datadog, New Relic, or similar unless asked to replace Grafana.
- **IaC**: app `infra/terraform/grafana/` (dedicated S3 state key) for app dashboards/synthetics/CloudWatch/GitHub DS. Shared Infinity + GitHub plugin: [`7oas7er/platform`](https://github.com/7oas7er/platform) `shared-obs`. Tokens only in gitignored tfvars or `GRAFANA_*` / related env vars.
- **Cloudflare** = DNS/edge only at the app root. Pull edge analytics into Grafana via GraphQL (shared Infinity). Skip Cloudflare Alloy on Free unless Business/Enterprise.
- **Dashboard template**: [`docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md`](../../docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md) — mandatory layout for new apps (proven on DressMe + Netrunner).

## Pattern for a public web app

1. **Synthetics (HTTP)** — prod + stg site URLs; critical API paths; labels `project`, `environment` (`prod`|`stg`), `kind` (`site`|`api`). Keep Free cheap (prod ~5m / ≤2 probes; stg ~15m / 1 probe).
2. **CloudWatch scrape** — IAM role trusted by Grafana Labs `008923505280` with `sts:ExternalId` = stack `prometheus_user_id`. Scrape app services (e.g. `AWS/Lambda`, `AWS/CloudFront` including **OriginLatency**); regions `eu-north-1` + `us-east-1` when CloudFront is involved. Tag resources; label `project=<app>`. Org RCP must exempt Grafana or AssumeRole fails.
3. **Cloudflare edge (Free)** — shared Infinity (platform) → GraphQL: `httpRequestsAdaptiveGroups`, `firewallEventsAdaptive` table. Do **not** query `firewallEventsAdaptiveGroups` on Free. App sets `cloudflare_zone_tag` only. Infinity queries go in `url_options.body_graphql_query`.
4. **GitHub Actions** — plugin installed by platform; app creates per-app GitHub DS + fine-grained PAT (Actions + Metadata read). Panel targets use `options.workflow` = workflow **file name**.
5. **Two env dashboards** — `<Product> — Production` and `<Product> — Staging` (not one mixed overview). Fixed-window traffic / errors / latency (hour→year; year via CloudWatch), then synthetics, Cloudflare volume / cache & bots / paths & firewall, GitHub CI. Generate JSON via an app script modeled on `infra/terraform/grafana/scripts/generate-env-dashboards.py`; publish with a stack service account. Full structure: [`docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md`](../../docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md).

**Do** reuse `project` / `environment` labels. **Don’t** add a second observability product, commit tokens/PATs/SA keys, or ship a single prod+stg overview dashboard.
